// TeleSales CRM Database Schema - COMPLETE VERSION
// Generated from SOW-Telesales CRM 1.pdf with 100% URS Coverage
// Use this file at https://dbdiagram.io/ to visualize the database structure
// Last Updated: 2026-05-22
//

// ============================================
// ENUMS
// ============================================


Enum assign_role {
  re
  agent
}

Enum task_status {
  pending
  overdue
  completed
  cancelled
}

Enum task_type {
  call
  follow_up
  appointment
  presentation
  general
}

Enum role_type {
  Admin
  Manager
  Agent
}

Enum appointment_type {
  sales
  telesales
}

Enum sales_type {
  re
  telesales
}

Enum consultation_type {
  personal
  telephone
  video
}

Enum call_origin {
  inbound
  outbound
  dialer
}

Enum presentation_status {
  presentation_done
  presentation_not_done
}

Enum sales_status {
  follow_up_call
  ready_to_enroll
  dropped
}

Enum follow_up_disposition {
  follow_up_cold
  follow_up_warm
  unable_to_contact
  will_enroll_after_1_week
  will_enroll_after_2_week
  will_enroll_after_3_week
  re_not_connected
  personal_ppt_required
  only_whatsapp_communication
  re_duplicated
  in_touch_with_re
  connected_on_whatsapp
  in_discussion_not_decided
  we_will_call_upfront
}

Enum dropped_reason {
  already_delivered
  cost_too_high
  demand_higher_discount
  doctor_not_recommended
  enrolled_with_competitor
  unable_to_establish_contact
  customer_cancelled_consultation
  concept
  already_enrolled_lifecell
  never_asked_appointment
  registered_free_gifts
  wants_free_stemcell_cover
  non_serviceable_area
  already_preserved_first_baby
  not_decision_maker
  high_collection_charges
  not_comfortable_self_collection
  no_symptoms_not_required
  referral_lead_created
  duplicate_done
}

Enum activity_type {
  lead_created
  lead_assigned
  lead_updated
  status_changed
  owner_changed
  dialer_activity
  call_made
  appointment_created
  appointment_updated
  presentation_updated
  note_added
  task_created
  task_updated
  stemcell_sync
  bulk_operation
  referral_created
}

Enum lead_stage {
  new
  contacted
  qualified
  appointment_scheduled
  presentation_completed
  follow_up
  ready_to_enroll
  enrolled
  dropped
  not_reachable
}





Enum notification_channel {
  email
  sms
  whatsapp
  push
  in_app
}

Enum sync_status {
  pending
  in_progress
  synced
  failed
  retry
}

Enum dialer_queue_status {
  queued
  calling
  completed
  failed
  skipped
}

Enum communication_template_type {
  task_reminder
  appointment_reminder
  follow_up
  welcome
  password_reset
  enrollment_confirmation
  presentation_scheduled
  custom
}

Enum eod_bucket_type {
  hot_lead
  warm_lead
  cold_lead
  follow_up_1_week
  follow_up_2_week
  follow_up_3_week
  not_reachable
  dropped
}

Enum calendar_slot_status {
  available
  booked
  blocked
  tentative
}

// ============================================
// USER MANAGEMENT TABLES
// ============================================

Table users {
  id int [pk, increment]
  email varchar(255) [unique, not null]
  first_name varchar(255) [not null]
  last_name varchar(255) [not null]
  password varchar(255) [not null, note: 'DPDP: Store as bcrypt/argon2 hash, never plain text']
  role_id int [null, ref : > role_details.id]
  phone varchar(255) [unique, not null]
  fk_manager_id int [null, ref: > users.id]
  is_active boolean [default: true]
  is_blocked boolean [default: false]
  password_changed_at timestamp [null]
  
  // CLIENT FEEDBACK #2: Last Login Tracking
  last_login_at timestamp [null, note: 'Track last successful login date/time']
  

  // CLIENT FEEDBACK #6: OTP-Based 2FA
  otp_code varchar(10) [null, note: 'DPDP: Encrypt OTP code']
  otp_expiry timestamp [null, note: 'OTP expiration timestamp']

  
  // Soft Delete
  is_deleted boolean [default: false, note: 'Soft delete flag']
  deleted_at timestamp [null]
  deleted_by int [null]
  
  // CLIENT FEEDBACK #1: Audit Fields
  created_at timestamp [default: `now()`]
  created_by int [null, ref: > users.id]
  updated_at timestamp [default: `now()`]
  modify_at timestamp [null]
  modify_by int [null, ref: > users.id]
 
  indexes {
    id
    email
    is_active
    role_id
    last_login_at
  }
  
  note: 'Main authentication table with 2FA, login tracking, and DPDP compliance'
}


// ============================================
// LEAD MANAGEMENT
// ============================================

Table leads {
  id int [pk, increment]
  lead_id int [unique, not null]
  first_name varchar(100) [not null]
  last_name varchar(100) [null]
  phone varchar(20) [not null]
  phone_country_code varchar(5) [default: '+91']
  alternate_phone varchar(20) [null]
  alternate_email varchar(200) [null]
  email varchar(255) [null]
  campaign_name varchar(255) [null]
  campaign_type varchar(100) [null]
  referrer_url text [null]
  landing_page_url text [null]
  
  // Medical/Sales Information
  pregnancy_edd date [null, note: 'Expected Delivery Date']
  pregnancy_week int [null]
  interested_product varchar(255) [null]
  referrer_crm_number varchar(255) [null]
  // System Information
  lead_status_id int [null, ref: > lead_status.id, note: 'Current status of the lead']
  lead_source_id int [null, ref: > lead_sources_master.id, note: 'Source of the lead']
  lead_medium_id int [null, ref: > lead_mediums_master.id, note: 'Medium of the lead']
  lead_stage lead_stage [default: 'new', note: 'Pipeline stage for visualization']
  owner_id int [null, ref: > users.id, note: 'Assigned agent/manager']
  assigned_at timestamp [null]
  assigned_by int [null, ref: > users.id]
  
  // Tracking & Validation
  call_attempt_count int [default: 0]
  last_contacted_at timestamp [null]
  first_contacted_at timestamp [null]
  is_duplicate boolean [default: false]
  duplicate_of_lead_id int [null]
  duplicate_checked_at timestamp [null]
  is_valid_lead boolean [default: true, note: 'For Daily Valid Leads report']
  is_engaged boolean [default: false, note: 'For Engaged Leads metric']
  engagement_date timestamp [null]
  is_resubmission boolean [default: false, note: 'For Resubmission leads report']
  original_submission_date timestamp [null]
  resubmission_count int [default: 0]
  is_nr7_triggered boolean [default: false, note: 'Not Reachable after 7 attempts']
  nr7_triggered_at timestamp [null]
  note text [null]
  is_manually int [default: 0]  
  // Quality & Scoring
  lead_score int [default: 0, note: 'Lead scoring for prioritization']  
  // Soft Delete
  is_deleted boolean [default: false, note: 'Soft delete flag']
  deleted_at timestamp [null]
  deleted_by int [null, ref: > users.id]
  deletion_reason text [null]
  
  created_at timestamp [default: `now()`]
  created_by int [null, ref: > users.id]
  updated_at timestamp [default: `now()`]
  modify_at timestamp [null]
  modify_by int [null, ref: > users.id]
  
  indexes {
    id
    lead_id
    phone [unique, note: 'Unique phone validation']
    email [unique, note: 'Unique email validation']
    lead_source_id
    lead_status_id
    created_at
  }
  
}

Table leads_address {
  id int [pk, increment]
  lead_id int [not null , ref: > leads.id]
  state_id int [null]
  city_id int [null]
  pincode varchar(10) [null]
  address text [null]
  hospital_id int [null]
  doctor_id int [null]
  is_deleted boolean [default: false, note: 'Soft delete flag']
  created_at timestamp [default: `now()`]
  created_by int [null, ref: > users.id]
  updated_at timestamp [default: `now()`]
  modify_at timestamp [null]
  modify_by int [null, ref: > users.id]
  
  indexes {
    id
    lead_id
    state_id
    city_id
  }
  
}

Table lead_status{
  id int [pk, increment]
  name varchar(100) [not null, note: 'Display name: New Lead, Callback, Interested, etc.']
  is_active boolean [default: true]
  created_at timestamp [default: `now()`]
  updated_at timestamp [default: `now()`]
  indexes {
    id
    is_active
  }
  
  note: 'Configurable lead statuses instead of hardcoded enum'
}

Table lead_sources_master {
  id int [pk, increment]
  name varchar(100) [not null, note: 'Facebook, Website, Instagram, etc.']
  is_active boolean [default: true]
  created_at timestamp [default: `now()`]
  updated_at timestamp [default: `now()`]

  indexes {
    id
    is_active
  }
  
  note: 'Master table for lead sources'
}

Table lead_mediums_master {
  id int [pk, increment]
  name varchar(100) [not null, note: 'CPC, Organic, Paid, etc.']
  is_active boolean [default: true]
  created_at timestamp [default: `now()`]
  created_by int [null, ref: > users.id]
  updated_at timestamp [default: `now()`]

  indexes {
    id
    is_active
  }
  
  note: 'Master table for lead mediums'
}

Table lead_activities {
  id int [pk, increment]
  lead_id int [not null, ref: > leads.id]
  activity_type activity_type [not null]
  appointment_id int [null, ref: > appointments.id]
  notes_id int [null, ref: > notes.id]
  automation_id int [null, ref: > automations.id]
  task_id int [null, ref: > tasks.id]
  dialer_id int [null, ref: > dialer_calls.id]
  description text [null]
  metadata json [null, note: 'Additional activity data']
  created_at timestamp [default: `now()`]
  created_by int [null, ref: > users.id]  
  indexes {
    id
    lead_id
    activity_type
    created_at
  }
}


Table audit_logs {
  id int [pk, increment]
  module_name varchar(100) [not null, note: 'leads, appointments, tasks, etc.']
  record_id int [not null, note: 'ID of the affected record']
  action varchar(50) [not null, note: 'created, updated, deleted, login, logout, export, etc.']
  old_value_json json [null, note: 'Previous state of the record']
  new_value_json json [null, note: 'New state of the record']
  created_at timestamp [default: `now()`]
  created_by int [null, ref: > users.id]
 
  indexes {
    id
    module_name
  }
  
  note: 'System-wide audit trail for all important actions'
}

Table integration_logs {
  id int [pk, increment]
  integration_name varchar(100) [not null, note: 'Dialer, Stemcell, WhatsApp, Email, Landing Pages']
  request_url text [not null]
  request_method varchar(10) [not null, note: 'GET, POST, PUT, DELETE']
  request_payload json [null, note: 'Request body/parameters']
  response_payload json [null, note: 'Response data']
  status_code int [null, note: 'HTTP status code']
  success_flag boolean [default: false]
  error_message text [null]
  response_time_ms int [null, note: 'Response time in milliseconds']
  lead_id int [null, ref: > leads.id, note: 'Associated lead if applicable']
  created_at timestamp [default: `now()`]
  indexes {
    id
    integration_name
    success_flag
    created_at
    lead_id
    status_code
  }
  
  note: 'All external API integration logs (Dialer, Stemcell, WhatsApp, Email, etc.)'
}



Table notes {
  id int [pk, increment]
  lead_id int [not null, ref: > leads.id]
  note text [not null]
  created_by int [not null, ref: > users.id]
  is_deleted boolean [default: false, note: 'Soft delete flag']
  deleted_at timestamp [null]
  deleted_by int [null, ref: > users.id]
  created_at timestamp [default: `now()`]
  updated_at timestamp [default: `now()`]
  modify_at timestamp [null]
  modify_by int [null, ref: > users.id]
  
  indexes {
    id
    lead_id
    created_by
  }
}

// ============================================
// TASK MANAGEMENT
// ============================================

Table tasks {
  id int [pk, increment]
  lead_id int [not null, ref: > leads.id]
  owner_id int [not null, ref: > users.id, note: 'Assigned user']
  subject varchar(255) [not null]
  description text [null]
  scheduled_at timestamp [not null]
  due_date timestamp [null]
  reminder_at timestamp [null]
  reminder_sent_at timestamp [null, note: 'Track if 15-min reminder was sent']
  status task_status [default: 'pending']
  completion_notes text [null]
  google_calendar_event_id varchar(255) [null]
  completed_at timestamp [null]
  completed_by int [null, ref: > users.id]
  cancelled_at timestamp [null]
  cancelled_by int [null, ref: > users.id]
  cancellation_reason text [null]
  is_deleted boolean [default: false, note: 'Soft delete flag']
  deleted_at timestamp [null]
  deleted_by int [null, ref: > users.id]
  created_at timestamp [default: `now()`]
  created_by int [null, ref: > users.id]
  updated_at timestamp [default: `now()`]
  modify_at timestamp [null]
  modify_by int [null, ref: > users.id]
  
  indexes {
    id
    lead_id
    owner_id
    status
    scheduled_at
    is_deleted
  }
  
}


// ============================================
// DIALER MANAGEMENT
// ============================================

Table dialer_calls {
  id int [pk, increment]
  lead_id int [not null, ref: > leads.id]
  agent_id int [not null, ref: > users.id]
  display_number varchar(20) [null]
  call_date_time timestamp [not null]
  call_duration int [null, note: 'Duration in seconds']
  call_origin call_origin [not null]
  owner int [null]
  dialer_status varchar(100) [null, note: 'Status from dialer system']
  raw_call_status varchar(100) [null, note: 'Raw status from service provider']
  crm_lead_status_id int [null, ref: > lead_status.id, note: 'Mapped CRM status']
  disposition_status varchar(100) [null]
  call_notes text [null]
  call_recording_url varchar(500) [null]
  attempt_number int [default: 1]
  created_at timestamp [default: `now()`]
  created_by int [null, ref: > users.id]
  updated_at timestamp [default: `now()`]
  modify_at timestamp [null]
  modify_by int [null, ref: > users.id]
  
  indexes {
    id
    lead_id
    agent_id
    dialer_status
    crm_lead_status_id
  }
}

// ============================================
// APPOINTMENT MANAGEMENT
// ============================================

Table appointments {
  id int [pk, increment]
  stemcell_appointment_id varchar(50) [unique, null, note: 'Generated from Stemcell app']
  lead_id int [not null, ref: > leads.id]
  appointment_type appointment_type [not null , note: "re or telesales"]
  consultation_type consultation_type [not null]
  phone varchar [not null]
  email varchar [not null]
  lead_status_id int [null, ref: > lead_status.id, note: 'Current status of the lead'] 
  contact_stage varchar [not null]
  // Assignment
  owner_id int [not null, ref: > users.id, note: 'User who created appointment']
  assign_sales_id int [not null]
  is_fallback_assignment boolean [default: false, note: 'True if assigned to RE manager due to unavailability']
  
  // Medical Information
  pregnancy_edd date [null]
  
  // Hospital/Doctor Assignment (for sales)
  state_id int [null]
  city_id int [null]
  hospital_id int [null]
  doctor_id int [null]
  address text [null]
  
  // Telesales specific
  preferred_language varchar(50) [null]
  
  // Scheduling
  original_appointment_date timestamp [null]
  current_appointment_date timestamp [null]
  confirmed_slot timestamp [null]
  
  // Status
  disposition_status varchar(100) [null, note: 'Final appointment outcome disposition']
  is_locked boolean [default: false, note: 'Locked after ID generation']
  is_synced_with_stemcell boolean [default: false]
  
  notes text [null]
  created_at timestamp [default: `now()`]
  created_by int [null, ref: > users.id]
  updated_at timestamp [default: `now()`]
  modify_at timestamp [null]
  modify_by int [null, ref: > users.id]
  
  indexes {
    id
    stemcell_appointment_id
    lead_id
    appointment_type
    current_appointment_date
    hospital_id
    doctor_id
    is_fallback_assignment
  }
}



// ============================================
// PRESENTATION STAGE
// ============================================

Table presentations {
  id int [pk, increment]
  lead_id int [not null, ref: > leads.id]
  appointment_id int [null, ref: > appointments.id]
  sales_type sales_type [note: "re or telesales"]
  assign_sales_id int [not null]
  presentation_status presentation_status [null]
  presentation_date date [null]
  sales_status sales_status [not null]
  plan_type varchar(100) [null]
  promo_code varchar [not null]
  version int [default: 1, note: 'Track presentation history versions']
  
  // Follow-up details
  follow_up_date_time timestamp [null]
  follow_up_disposition follow_up_disposition [null]
  is_missed_followup boolean [default: false, note: 'For Missed follow-up report']
  
  // Push to sales
  push_to_sales boolean [default: false]
  push_follow_up_to_sales boolean [default: false]
  confirm_enrollment_followup boolean [default: false]
  sales_push_type varchar(50) [null]
  
  // Hospital/Doctor for sales push (IDs and text fields)
  state_id int [null]
  city_id int [null]
  hospital_id int [null]
  doctor_id int [null]
  centre varchar(100) [null]
  
  // Dropped reason
  dropped_reason dropped_reason [null]
  
  notes text [null]
  created_at timestamp [default: `now()`]
  created_by int [null, ref: > users.id]
  updated_at timestamp [default: `now()`]
  modify_at timestamp [null]
  modify_by int [null, ref: > users.id]
  
  indexes {
    id
    lead_id
    appointment_id
    presentation_status
    sales_status
    presentation_date
    follow_up_date_time
    is_missed_followup
  }
}


// ============================================
// SEF/ENROLLMENT STAGE
// ============================================

Table sef_enrollments {
  id int [pk, increment]
  lead_id int [not null, ref: > leads.id]
  appointment_id int [null, ref: > appointments.id]
  crm_number varchar(100) [unique, null]
  
  // Customer Information
  customer_name varchar(255) [not null]
  
  // SEF Details
  sef_date timestamp [not null]
  plan_detail text [null]
  
  // RE Information
  re_name varchar(255) [null]
  re_code varchar(50) [null]
  centre varchar(100) [null]
  branch_code varchar(50) [null]
  
  // Medical Information
  pregnancy_edd date [null]
  presentation_date date [null]
  
  // Status
  lead_status_id int [null, ref: > lead_status.id]
  telesales_or_sales varchar(50) [null]
  presentation_status varchar(100) [null]
  sales_status varchar(100) [null]
  overall_status varchar(100) [null]
  
  // Appointment tracking
  appointment_created_date timestamp [null]
  original_appointment_due_date timestamp [null]
  current_appointment_due_date timestamp [null]
  check_in_prior_1hr_clicked boolean [default: false]
  
  notes text [null]
  created_at timestamp [default: `now()`]
  created_by int [null, ref: > users.id]
  updated_at timestamp [default: `now()`]
  modify_at timestamp [null]
  modify_by int [null, ref: > users.id]
  
  indexes {
    lead_id
    appointment_id
    sef_date
    re_code
  }
}

Table enrollment_audit_logs {
  id int [pk, increment]
  enrollment_id int [not null, ref: > sef_enrollments.id]
  field_name varchar(100) [not null, note: 'Which field was changed']
  old_value text [null, note: 'Previous value']
  new_value text [null, note: 'New value']
  change_reason text [null, note: 'Optional reason for change']
  created_at timestamp [default: `now()`]
  created_by int [null, ref: > users.id]
  indexes {
    id
    enrollment_id
    field_name
  }
  
  note: 'Critical audit trail for SEF/Enrollment changes'
}

// ============================================
// AUTOMATION
// ============================================

Table automations {
  id int [pk, increment]
  name varchar(255) [not null]
  description text [null]
  automation_type varchar(100) [not null, note: 'lead_status_update, dialer_push, nr7_journey, p2e_journey, etc.']
  flow_definition json [not null, note: 'Automation flow configuration']
  is_active boolean [default: true]
  created_at timestamp [default: `now()`]
  created_by int [null, ref: > users.id]
  updated_at timestamp [default: `now()`]
  modify_at timestamp [null]
  modify_by int [null, ref: > users.id]
  
  indexes {
    automation_type
    is_active
  }
}

Table automation_logs {
  id int [pk, increment]
  automation_id int [not null, ref: > automations.id]
  lead_id int [null, ref: > leads.id]
  trigger_event varchar(100) [not null, note: 'nr7_triggered, p2e_ready, etc.']
  action_taken varchar(255) [not null]
  status varchar(50) [not null, note: 'success, failed, skipped']
  error_message text [null]
  execution_time_ms int [null]
  executed_at timestamp [default: `now()`]
  created_at timestamp [default: `now()`]
  indexes {
    automation_id
    lead_id
    trigger_event
    status
    executed_at
  }
  
  note: 'Detailed automation execution logs'
}

// ============================================
// ADDITIONAL USER MANAGEMENT
// ============================================

Table user_session {
  id int [pk, increment]
  user_id int [not null, ref: > users.id]
  token varchar(255) [unique, not null]
  expires_at timestamp [not null]
  refresh_token varchar(255) [unique, not null]
  refresh_expires_at timestamp [not null]
  created_at timestamp [default: `now()`]
  updated_at timestamp [default: `now()`]

  indexes {
    user_id
    token
    expires_at
  }
  
  note: 'Password reset token management'
}



// ============================================
// DIALER QUEUE & WORKING HOURS
// ============================================

Table dialer_queue {
  id int [pk, increment]
  lead_id int [not null, ref: > leads.id]
  agent_id int [null, ref: > users.id, note: 'Assigned agent for the call']
  priority int [default: 0, note: 'Higher number = higher priority']
  scheduled_call_time timestamp [not null]
  is_immediate_dial boolean [default: false, note: 'True for 1-min dial, false for next-day']
  queue_status dialer_queue_status [default: 'queued']
  attempt_number int [default: 1]
  last_attempt_at timestamp [null]
  next_retry_at timestamp [null]
  error_message text [null]
  created_at timestamp [default: `now()`]
  created_by int [null, ref: > users.id]
  updated_at timestamp [default: `now()`]
  modify_at timestamp [null]
  modify_by int [null, ref: > users.id]
  
  indexes {
    lead_id
    agent_id
    queue_status
  }
  
  note: 'Dialer call queue with priority management'
}

Table working_hours_config {
  id int [pk, increment]
  day_of_week int [not null, note: '0=Sunday, 1=Monday, ..., 6=Saturday']
  start_time time [not null]
  end_time time [not null]
  is_working_day boolean [default: true]
  timezone varchar(50) [default: 'Asia/Kolkata']
  created_at timestamp [default: `now()`]
  created_by int [null, ref: > users.id]
  updated_at timestamp [default: `now()`]
  modify_at timestamp [null]
  modify_by int [null, ref: > users.id]
  
  indexes {
    day_of_week
    is_working_day
  }
  
  note: 'System working hours configuration for dialer'
}

// ============================================
// CALENDAR & AVAILABILITY
// ============================================

Table agent_leave_calendar {
  id int [pk, increment]
  agent_id int [not null, ref: > users.id]
  leave_start_date date [not null]
  leave_end_date date [not null]
  leave_count int [not null]
  is_cancel boolean
  leave_type varchar(50) [null, note: 'sick, vacation, personal, etc.']
  reason text [null]
  created_at timestamp [default: `now()`]
  created_by int [null, ref: > users.id]
  updated_at timestamp [default: `now()`]
  modify_at timestamp [null]
  modify_by int [null, ref: > users.id]
  
  indexes {
    agent_id
    leave_start_date
    leave_end_date
  }
  
  note: 'Agent leave calendar for telesales availability'
}


Table google_calendar_integration {
  id int [pk, increment]
  user_id int [unique, not null, ref: > users.id]
  access_token text [not null]
  refresh_token text [not null]
  token_expires_at timestamp [not null]
  calendar_id varchar(255) [null]
  is_active boolean [default: true]
  last_sync_at timestamp [null]
  created_at timestamp [default: `now()`]
  created_by int [null, ref: > users.id]
  updated_at timestamp [default: `now()`]
  modify_at timestamp [null]
  modify_by int [null, ref: > users.id]
  
  indexes {
    user_id
    is_active
  }
  
  note: 'Google Calendar integration tokens and settings'
}



// ============================================
// COMMUNICATION TEMPLATES
// ============================================

Table communication_templates {
  id int [pk, increment]
  template_name varchar(255) [not null]
  template_type communication_template_type [not null]
  channel notification_channel [not null]
  subject varchar(500) [null, note: 'For email']
  body text [not null, note: 'Template with placeholders like {{first_name}}']
  variables json [null, note: 'List of available variables']
  is_active boolean [default: true]
  created_at timestamp [default: `now()`]
  created_by int [null, ref: > users.id]
  updated_at timestamp [default: `now()`]
  modify_at timestamp [null]
  modify_by int [null, ref: > users.id]
  
  indexes {
    template_type
    channel
    is_active
  }
  
  note: 'Email, SMS, WhatsApp communication templates'
}

// ============================================
// REFERRAL TRACKING
// ============================================

Table referral_tracking {
  id int [pk, increment]
  referrer_lead_id int [not null, ref: > leads.id, note: 'Lead who referred']
  referred_lead_id int [not null, ref: > leads.id, note: 'New lead created from referral']
  referral_code varchar(50) [null]
  referral_source varchar(100) [null]
  referral_date timestamp [not null]
  is_converted boolean [default: false]
  conversion_date timestamp [null]
  reward_given boolean [default: false]
  notes text [null]
  created_at timestamp [default: `now()`]
  created_by int [null, ref: > users.id]
  updated_at timestamp [default: `now()`]
  modify_at timestamp [null]
  modify_by int [null, ref: > users.id]
  
  indexes {
    referrer_lead_id
    referred_lead_id
    referral_code
    is_converted
  }
  
  note: 'Track referral automation and attribution'
}

// ============================================
// STEMCELL INTEGRATION QUEUE
// ============================================

Table stemcell_api_logs {
  id int [pk, increment]
  url varchar(255) [not null]
  request_payload json [null]
  response_payload json [null]
  is_success boolean [default: false]
  error_message text [null]
  created_at timestamp [default: `now()`]
  indexes {
    id
    is_success
    created_at
  }
  
  note: 'Detailed API call logs for Stemcell integration'
}



// ============================================
// ADVANCED SEARCH & FILTERS
// ============================================

Table saved_filters {
  id int [pk, increment]
  user_id int [not null, ref: > users.id]
  filter_name varchar(255) [not null]
  filter_type varchar(50) [not null, note: 'leads, appointments, presentations, tasks']
  filter_conditions json [not null, note: 'If/Else conditions']
  is_default boolean [default: false]
  is_shared boolean [default: false]
  created_at timestamp [default: `now()`]
  created_by int [null, ref: > users.id]
  updated_at timestamp [default: `now()`]
  modify_at timestamp [null]
  modify_by int [null, ref: > users.id]
  
  indexes {
    user_id
    filter_type
    is_default
  }
  
  note: 'User saved search filters with If/Else conditions'
}

// ============================================
// COMMUNICATION TRACKING
// ============================================

Table email_notifications {
  id int [pk, increment]
  lead_id int [null, ref: > leads.id]
  user_id int [null, ref: > users.id]
  task_id int [null, ref: > tasks.id]
  email_to varchar(255) [not null]
  email_subject varchar(500) [not null]
  email_body text [not null]
  email_type varchar(100) [not null, note: 'task_reminder, appointment_reminder, password_reset, etc.']
  sent_at timestamp [null]
  status varchar(50) [default: 'pending', note: 'pending, sent, failed']
  error_message text [null]
  created_at timestamp [default: `now()`]


  indexes {
    lead_id
    user_id
    task_id
    email_type
    status
    sent_at
  }
}

Table sms_notifications {
  id int [pk, increment]
  lead_id int [null, ref: > leads.id]
  phone varchar(20) [not null]
  message text [not null]
  sms_type varchar(100) [not null]
  sent_at timestamp [null]
  status varchar(50) [default: 'pending']
  error_message text [null]
  created_at timestamp [default: `now()`]
 

  indexes {
    lead_id
    phone
    sms_type
    status
    sent_at
  }
}

Table whatsapp_notifications {
  id int [pk, increment]
  lead_id int [null, ref: > leads.id]
  phone varchar(20) [not null]
  message text [not null]
  whatsapp_type varchar(100) [not null]
  sent_at timestamp [null]
  status varchar(50) [default: 'pending']
  error_message text [null]
  created_at timestamp [default: `now()`]

  indexes {
    lead_id
    phone
    whatsapp_type
    status
    sent_at
  }
}

Table module {
  id int [pk, increment]
  name varchar [not null]
  is_deleted boolean [default: 'false']
  created_at timestamp [default: `now()`]
  updated_at timestamp [default: `now()`]
}

Table module_permission {
  id int [pk, increment]
  module_id int [null, ref: > module.id]
  name varchar [not null]
  is_deleted boolean [default: 'false']
  created_at timestamp [default: `now()`]
  updated_at timestamp [default: `now()`]
 
  indexes {
    module_id
    id
  }
}

Table role_details{
   id int [pk, increment]
   role_name varchar [not null]
   role_type role_type [not null]
   is_active boolean [default: true]
   is_deleted boolean [default: 'false']
   created_at timestamp [default: `now()`]
   updated_at timestamp [default: `now()`]
   modify_at timestamp [null]
   modify_by int [null, ref: > users.id]
}

Table role_permission {
  id int [pk, increment]
  module_permission_id int [null, ref: > module_permission.id]
  role_details_id int [null, ref: > role_details.id]
  is_deleted boolean [default: 'false']
  created_at timestamp [default: `now()`]
  created_by int [null, ref: > users.id]
  updated_at timestamp [default: `now()`]
  modify_at timestamp [null]
  modify_by int [null, ref: > users.id]

  indexes {
    module_permission_id
    role_details_id
    id
  }
}

// ============================================
// REPORTS CONFIGURATION
// ============================================

Table reports {
  id int [pk, increment]
  report_name varchar(255) [not null, note: 'Daily Leads Report, Agent Productivity, etc.']
  report_code varchar(100) [unique, not null, note: 'daily_leads, agent_productivity']
  description text [null]
  category varchar(50) [null, note: 'leads, appointments, performance, analytics']
  query_json json [null, note: 'SQL query or query builder JSON']
  is_active boolean [default: true]
  is_scheduled boolean [default: false, note: 'Auto-generate on schedule']
  schedule_cron varchar(100) [null, note: 'Cron expression for scheduling']
  created_at timestamp [default: `now()`]
  created_by int [null, ref: > users.id]
  updated_at timestamp [default: `now()`]
  modify_at timestamp [null]
  modify_by int [null, ref: > users.id]
  
  indexes {
    id
    report_code
    category
    is_active
  }
  
  note: 'Configurable report definitions'
}


// ============================================
// NOTIFICATION UNSUBSCRIBE
// ============================================

Table notification_preferences {
  id int [pk, increment]
  lead_id int [unique, not null, ref: > leads.id]
  email_enable boolean [default: false, note: 'Unsubscribe from emails']
  whatsapp_enable boolean [default: false, note: 'Unsubscribe from WhatsApp']
  sms_enable boolean [default: false, note: 'Unsubscribe from SMS']
  dnd_enabled boolean [default: false, note: 'Do Not Disturb - no calls']
  reason text [null]
  created_at timestamp [default: `now()`]
  created_by int [null, ref: > users.id]
  updated_at timestamp [default: `now()`]
  modify_at timestamp [null]
  modify_by int [null, ref: > users.id]
  
  indexes {
    lead_id
    email_enable
    whatsapp_enable
    sms_enable
    dnd_enabled
  }
  
  note: 'Lead-level notification preferences and unsubscribe'
}

// ============================================
// AGENT PERFORMANCE TABLES
// ============================================

Table agent_performance {
  id int [pk, increment]
  agent_id int [not null, ref: > users.id]
  performance_date date [not null]
  total_leads_assigned int [default: 0]
  total_calls_made int [default: 0]
  connected_calls int [default: 0]
  appointments_set int [default: 0]
  presentations_done int [default: 0]
  enrollments int [default: 0]
  conversion_rate decimal(5,2) [null, note: 'Percentage']
  avg_call_duration int [null, note: 'Average in seconds']
  total_talk_time int [default: 0, note: 'Total in seconds']
  created_at timestamp [default: `now()`]
  created_by int [null, ref: > users.id]
  updated_at timestamp [default: `now()`]
  modify_at timestamp [null]
  modify_by int [null, ref: > users.id]
  
  indexes {
    agent_id
    performance_date
    (agent_id, performance_date) [unique]
  }
  
 
}



